    "detailed_description": "A village attacked by a mysterious figure. A Guardian, dead in it's defense. And you, left to tell the wider world of what happened. In this top-down RPG, you play as Mael, a young human whose home is befell by foul forces, only to find themselves tasked with finding help in the aftermath. Quickly, the situation escalates as you find yourself investigating what is shown to be only one piece of a far larger plan...<br><br><i>Face a variety of enemies in either random encounters of in the overworld, climbing your way up to their leader!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/074bde1f141f57c37f07cfaf4d1ae6f3.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Find weapons and armour for your character, with sprites that change and adapt to your equipped armour!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/1003e5f8f9237e5b4d2b875c2a1381b4.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/2a8119960fcee3a0401181ee97d35f26.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Unlock powerful skills to help your offence, defence and movement in the bullet-hell style combat, with each of the three styles of magic excelling in their domains! </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/fe8084384801723e892ad8cb65f49300.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Restore the light of the Lumiars for extra skill points, and perhaps something more\u2026</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/d16eb6b64ac7b65266a00b393503c036.avif?t=1712708304\" width=612 height=300 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "A village attacked by a mysterious figure. A Guardian, dead in it's defense. And you, left to tell the wider world of what happened. In this top-down RPG, you play as Mael, a young human whose home is befell by foul forces, only to find themselves tasked with finding help in the aftermath. Quickly, the situation escalates as you find yourself investigating what is shown to be only one piece of a far larger plan...<br><br><i>Face a variety of enemies in either random encounters of in the overworld, climbing your way up to their leader!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/074bde1f141f57c37f07cfaf4d1ae6f3.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Find weapons and armour for your character, with sprites that change and adapt to your equipped armour!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/1003e5f8f9237e5b4d2b875c2a1381b4.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/2a8119960fcee3a0401181ee97d35f26.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Unlock powerful skills to help your offence, defence and movement in the bullet-hell style combat, with each of the three styles of magic excelling in their domains! </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/fe8084384801723e892ad8cb65f49300.avif?t=1712708304\" width=610 height=300 /></span><br><br><i>Restore the light of the Lumiars for extra skill points, and perhaps something more\u2026</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2756190/extras/d16eb6b64ac7b65266a00b393503c036.avif?t=1712708304\" width=612 height=300 /></span>",
